OL,3,AFirst results projected in US midterms
OL,4,Aas survey suggests most voters unhappy
OL,5,Awith economy
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe first polls have closed in the US
OL,8,Fmidterm elections, which will decide
OL,9,Fwho controls Congress for the rest of
OL,10,FDonald Trump's presidency - when will
OL,11,Fwe get results?
OL,13,FA majority of voters are unhappy with
OL,14,Fthe economy, an election day survey
OL,15,Fsuggests - read the latest from our
OL,16,Fdata team
OL,18,FWith major results yet to come in, a
OL,19,FWhite House official tells the BBC the
OL,20,Fmood is "cautiously optimistic"
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
