OL,3,AFirst results projected in US midterms
OL,4,Aas survey suggests most voters unhappy
OL,5,Awith economy
OL,6,
OL,7,FWhat's up for grabs? All 435 seats in
OL,8,Fthe House; 35 of the 100 seats in the
OL,9,FSenate; and some state-level
OL,10,Fpoliticians, including governors - here
OL,11,Fare the key races
OL,13,FTrump's Republican Party currently
OL,14,Fcontrols the House and the Senate - how
OL,15,Fmany seats must the Democrats win to
OL,16,Ftake control?
